<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Friday's matches:</p>
<p>3 goals - Laurent Blanc (Marseille)</p>
<p>2 - Florian Maurice (Paris St Germain), Lionel Rouxel</p>
<p>(Guingamp), Didier Martel (Chateauroux), Bruno Rodriguez (Metz),</p>
<p>Tony Vairelles (Lens), David Zitelli (Strasbourg), Lilian</p>
<p>Laslandes (Bordeaux)</p>
</text>
